203+  08B0                      ; Match Project125's proven DMA completion watchdog: eight full
204+  08B0                      ; 16-bit polling windows. A single #FFFF window expires before the
205+  08B0                      ; ATM can finish a 16 KiB LDIR at its host clock.
206+  08B0 16 08                ld      d,P126_NGS_DMA_WAIT_OUTER
